<title>JAPAN: Reuters average May Tapis assessed at $21.18.</title>
<headline>Reuters average May Tapis assessed at $21.18.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average Reuters price for Malaysian Tapis for May was $21.18.</p>
<p>Malaysia's Petronas uses Reuters morning quotes in its monthly term crude formula. Reuters prices:</p>
<p>	   May 1  $20.83  13  $21.05  22  $21.65</p>
<p>		 2  $20.83  14  $21.50  23  $21.80</p>
<p>		 5  $20.65  15  $21.15  26  $21.70</p>
<p>		 6  $20.65  16  $21.23  27  $21.65</p>
<p>		 7  $20.65  19  $21.38  28  $21.65</p>
<p>		 8  $20.63  20  $21.70  29  $21.15</p>
<p>		 9  $20.63  21  $21.60  30  $21.25</p>
<p>		12  $20.63</p>
</text>
